k><name>AKAMATSU, KOICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA, MANABU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUBISHI DENKI KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AKAMATSU KOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA MANABU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AKAMATSU, KOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA, MANABU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>When a device for attaching/detaching a SIM card (600) is fitted  to a portable telephone (500), a projection (420) provided on an operation lever (400) is viewed through a lever hole (511) made in a case (510).  Therefore, by moving the projection (420) with a finger, a cover (300) of the device fitted inside the case (510) can be slid.  A SIM card attaching/detaching slot (512) provid ed in the case (510) is present on the extension line of a housing section (120) housing a body (100) of the device.  When a SIM  card (600) is inserted through the slot (512), the card (600) is housed in the housing section.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Lorsqu'un dispositif de retenue/libération d'une carte SIM (600) est adapté sur un téléphone portable (500), une saillie (420) située sur un levier d'actionnement (400) devient visible à travers une fenêtre (511) faisant apparaître le levier, pratiquée dans le boîtier (510). Ainsi, en déplaçant la saillie (420) avec un doigt, on fait coulisser un couvercle (300) du dispositif adapté à l'intérieur du boîtier (510). Une fente (512) de retenue/libération de la carte SIM, pratiquée dans le boîtier (510), se situe dans le prolongement d'une section logement (120) dans lequel est logé le corps (100) du dispositif. Lorsqu'une carte SIM est insérée par la fente (512), la carte (600) vient se loger dans la section logement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>